--- !u!114 &-5611189802621453162
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2818dd0c5b404dfe8aedaf83b49ab7b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Also wie gsagd, ...
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: cod.dialogbuilder::Nodes.Decorator.NpcDialogOption
  Guid: 0e8400e36b69f4579b2d0e35c587d46f
  Position: {x: -149.99995, y: 993.0002}
  customPreview: 0
  Blackboard:
    CharacterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62b539070ac644f6eb8e8be906c4d929, type: 2}
  DialogLine: "Also wie gsagd, du duschd ihn jeda dag f\xFCddern. Gibschd hald druff
    achd, dess ned zu warm, ned zu kald isch d\xE4m Sauerdeich. Du haschd wahrscheinlich
    no nie na Sauerdeich agsedzd vorhr gll? Also von dene Sauerdeich, des isch des
    gudde, isch ja scho agsedzd, du musschd nur schee achd geba, dess er ned verk\xFCmmerd
    da. Ond Wenn du Fraga haschd, du kannsch mi ja jederzeid fraga. Hab i no was
    vergessa? Soll i's dir liebr ufschreiba? Muschdi drum k\xFCmmern wie so a, wie
    heissetse? Damagodschi?"
  DialogLineEn: So like I said, you feed him every day. Just mind it isn't too warm, not too cold for the sourdough. You've likely never started a sourdough before, right? Well, with these sourdoughs, that's the good bit, he's already started, you just have to keep a close eye that he doesn't waste away. And if you've got questions, you can ask me any time. Have I forgotten owt? Should I write it down for you? You've to look after him like one of them, what do they call them? Tamagotchi?
  TextPreview: Also wie gsagd, ...
  AudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de78c991ebadf49cabefb225fd82d1dd, type: 3}
  ClipVolume: 1
  PauseAfter: 0.5
