--- !u!114 &-620175061639583468
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2818dd0c5b404dfe8aedaf83b49ab7b1, type: 3}
  m_Name: "\u201EAlso wie gsagd,..."
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: cod.dialogbuilder::Nodes.Decorator.NpcDialogOption
  Guid: 1b733270bfd5f48198317d6648000357
  Position: {x: 1760.2494, y: 911.37006}
  customPreview: 0
  Blackboard:
    CharacterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62b539070ac644f6eb8e8be906c4d929, type: 2}
  DialogLine: "\u201EAlso wie gsagd, du duschd ihn jeda dag f\xFCddern. Gibsch au
    drauf Acht, dass ned zu warm\noder zu kalt isch dem Sauerteig. Du haschd wahrscheinlich
    no nie na\nSauerdeich agsedzd vorhr gll? Also von dene Sauerdeich, des\nisch
    des gudde, isch ja scho agsedzd, du musschd nur schee\nachd geba, dess er ned
    verk\xFCmmerd da. Ond Wenn du Fraga haschd, du kannsch mi ja jederzeid fraga.
    Hab i no was vergessa? Soll i's dir liebr ufschreiba? Muschdi drum k\xFCmmern
    wie dengs, die..\nwie hoi\xDFet se? Damagodschi?"
  DialogLineEn: "So like I said, you feed him every day. And mind that it isn't too warm\nor too cold for the sourdough. You've likely never started a\nsourdough before, right? Well, with these sourdoughs, that's\nthe good bit, he's already started, you just have to keep a\nclose eye that he doesn't waste away. And if you've got questions, you can ask me any time. Have I forgotten owt? Should I write it down for you? You've to look after him like one of them..\nwhat do they call them? Tamagotchi?"
  TextPreview: "\u201EAlso wie gsagd,..."
  AudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: de78c991ebadf49cabefb225fd82d1dd, type: 3}
  ClipVolume: 1
  PauseAfter: 0.5
  Children: []
  FallThrough: 0
  IsAvailable: 1
  IsTrustOption: 0
  IsBondingOption: 0
  RequiredNodes: []
  BlockerNodes: []
  PopularityValue: 0
