    das langsame sich immer wiederholende Klopfen macht einem deutlich, dass es storyrelevant
    ist.)"
  DialogLineEn: There are three slow knocks at the door. (Unlike Paul, Hilde does not stop knocking; you can move around the house freely, but the slow, endlessly repeating knocking makes it clear that this is story-relevant.)
