    CharacterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62b539070ac644f6eb8e8be906c4d929, type: 2}
  DialogLine: "Ach, wusschdesch des wirklich gar ned? Jo, die isch dod. I hadde mi
    scho gfragd, warum du ned zu der Berdigung komma bisch. Umso wichdigr, dess du
    den Sauerdeich bkommsd\u2026 bagg ihn am beschten ein."
  DialogLineEn: "Oh, did you really not know? Aye, she's dead. I'd wondered why you didn't come to the funeral. All the more reason for you to get the sourdough\u2026 best pack him up."
