    CharacterData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 62b539070ac644f6eb8e8be906c4d929, type: 2}
  DialogLine: "Ha des isch a Sach, dass I di glei verwisch! Hab\u2019s mr halber
    denkt dass du dahanna bisch. Du I muss dr was gebba. Da heb mol. Libbenschdifd,
    Schl\xFCsselbund, Gs\xE4lz f\xFCr d\u2019Oma, die Rubbellose f\xFCr de Andi\u2026
    Also was wichtig isch, du musch den regelm\xE4\xDFig f\xFCttern, ah was sag I,
    am beschda jeden Tag gell. Wo isch er no jetzt?"
  DialogLineEn: "Ha, what a thing that I catch you right off! Half thought you'd be here. Listen, I have to give you something. Here, hold this. Lipstick, keyring, jam for granny, the scratch cards for Andi\u2026 So what's important, you have to feed him regularly, ah what am I saying, every day is best, right. Where's he got to now?"
  TextPreview: Ha des isch a Sa...
